<title>UK: BOE allots 225 mln stg in UK repo.</title>
<headline>BOE allots 225 mln stg in UK repo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England allotted 225 million stg in repos to the UK money market in an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 1.6 billion stg.</p>
<p>The repos are to August 5 &amp; 6 and the repo rate was unchanged at 6.75 percent.</p>
</text>
